ClassDescription,"A fluid DOTA2 hero who commands surging waves, shifts freely between Strength and Agility, empowers himself through Ebb & Flow, and morphs into foes.","Un fluido héroe de DOTA2 que domina las olas crecientes, alterna libremente entre Fuerza y Agilidad, se potencia con Flujo y Reflujo y adopta la forma de sus enemigos."
ClassDescription,"A masked DOTA2 blademaster who builds unstoppable momentum through Bladeform, carves through magic with Blade Fury, sustains allies with Healing Ward, and cuts down foes with Blade Dance and Omnislash.","Un espadachín enmascarado de DOTA2 que acumula impulso imparable con Forma de hoja, atraviesa la magia con Furia de la hoja, sostiene a sus aliados con Guardián sanador y abate enemigos con Danza de la hoja y Omnislash."
ClassDescription,"A relentless DOTA2 crimson berserker who thrives alone with One Man Army, taunts entire rooms with Berserker's Call, carves attackers with Pure Counter Helix spins, and executes the weak with Culling Blade.",
